OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fwill gradually die away through this
OL,7,Fevening. Then the rest of the night
OL,8,Fwill be mainly dry with clear periods.
OL,9,FChilly in some sheltered Highland
OL,10,Fglens.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FStarting off dry with some
OL,13,Fsunshine. Cloudier in the afternoon
OL,14,Fwith a few passing showers.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,17,Fdry over the weekend although the odd
OL,18,Fshower still possible in the west.
OL,19,FRain likely to spread northeast on
OL,20,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
